            <ArticleTitle>Gerard cup arthroplasty in inflammatory arthropathy of the hip.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>179-84</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sixteen hips in 11 patients with an inflammatory hip arthropathy were treated with an uncemented, double-cup arthroplasty (Gerard design). The results were good in ten patients after a mean follow-up period of 4.1 years.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
